te.dev/search?q=uuid:c294ca4c-b2e1-4ebd-81ff-5a6fd6fa12e5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the third floor / bedroom of the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-28&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-295</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this book unlocks a dialog option with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/25px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/38px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/50px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bernard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/25px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a> that pacifies him and the rest of the <a href=\"/wiki/Animated_Armour\" title=\"Animated Armour\">Animated Armours</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>THE ROADS TO DARKNESS\n</p><p>An epic tragedy about power, corruption, and loneliness\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>PROLOGUE. A lonely road.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><i>Thunder and lightning. Enter Soreth</i>\n</p><p>SORETH:\n</p><p>New sounds through damp and dark oppression break  \n</p><p>Is it the foe, that foul, contemptuous heel?\n</p><p>Or art thou friend, a rescue from my lonely wake?\n</p><p>Come out of love for me, not love for blood and steel.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><i>Enter Rysia</i>\n</p><p>RYSIA:\n</p><p>How would I know, how would I know, Soreth?\n</p><p>It's been so long, what do I know of you\n</p><p>And you of me?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>SORETH:\n</p><p>Wait – do you hear that sound?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><i>Enter Amphius</i>\n</p><p>AMPHIUS:\n</p><p>What's this? Those figures so familiar both\n</p><p>But still you seem so strange.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>SORETH:\n</p><p>It's Amphius.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>RYSIA:\n</p><p>Dear Amphius! What happened to your face?\n</p><p>It's pale as death.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>SORETH:\n</p><p>Your eyes are black as <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>AMPHIUS:\n</p><p>And you? <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">I saw your teeth, they're sharp as blades</a>.\n</p><p>And what is with this road, so slick with blood?\n</p><p>What happened here? What happened to us all?\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><i>Exeunt</i>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>END PROLOGUE\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>ACT I. Ten years prior.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The rest of the play tells the tale of three elven friends, their paths to power, and how – corrupted, mad, and lonely – they killed each other.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The book is written in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iambic_pentameter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Iambic pentameter\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iambic_pentameter\">Iambic pentameter</a></span>, a style associated with Elizabethan playwrights like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"William Shakespeare\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare\">William Shakespeare</a></span>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2179/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37583/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13476/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979886/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.843      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   57.843      1 -total\n 57.82%   33.448     10 Template:Icon_text\n 50.10%   28.977     23 Template:Trim\n 24.70%   14.290      2 Template:Uid\n 17.62%   10.194      5 Template:Icon_link\n 14.52%    8.398      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.03%    6.378      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.33%    5.975     10 Template:Ifempty\n  8.40%    4.862     10 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12799-0!canonical a